<title>NETHERLANDS: DUTCH HOOGOVENS WINS SLOVAK ORDER.</title>
<headline>DUTCH HOOGOVENS WINS SLOVAK ORDER.</headline>
<dateline>BEVERWIJK, Netherlands 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch steel and aluminium group Koninklijke Hoogovens said on Tuesday its unit Hoogovens Technical Services (HTS) had won an order worth 18 million guilders from steel maker VSZ-Kozice in Slovakia.</p>
<p>HTS will handle the engineering side of a project to renovate a furnace and will supervise the installation.</p>
<p>The unit won a similar order from Italy's Gruppo Lucchini in May. HTS is also involved in steel mill renovations in the U.S. and South Africa.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
